<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2004/04/25 (日) 12:20:36 <strong>▽</strong> メガ\ </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs.cgi?res=200404250122036&log=akatori">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200404250122036"></font>
